            overview: "[ Link] This epic covers all Tier 2 additions to Slack for Revenue, building on the Freemium tier. It introduces the paid \"Slack for Revenue Add-On\" SKU with a platform fee + consumption model. New capabilities: fixed-term subscription quoting, usage-based product quoting, product bundle quoting, quote-to-order conversion in Slack, expanded product catalog management (15 products), and elevated Slackbot conversation limits. All Tier 1 capabilities are included. License: Slack for Revenue Add-On (new SKU) | Slack license: Business+ V2 or Enterprise | Monetization: Platform fee + consumption (TBD) User Stories (Tier 2 additions) Admin (Sam): As an admin, I want Tier 2 capabilities to unlock immediately upon Add-On purchase, so that my team can use them without manual setup. As an admin, I want to manage up to 15 products entirely from Slack bot or in product lists, so that the catalog stays current without IT involvement. As an admin, I want to configure usage-based products (unit of measure, unit price) via Slackbot, so that reps can include them in quotes without Salesforce setup. As an admin, I want to define product bundles via Slackbot, so that reps see bundles as a single selectable item. As an admin, I want a notification if our Tier 2 license lapses, so that we know which capabilities are affected before they stop working. Sales Rep (Alex): As a rep, I want to create a quote with fixed-term subscriptions, so that I can sell annual contracts and show the customer the ful…",
