        id: 22,
        title: "DLM-264-P0: Slack Approvals Acceleration",
        description: "Please read carefully in the section, it has been structured in the spec driven way, and contains Q&A, context info, that can be helpful for planning and breakdown. Link This epic includes the advanced-only Slack Approval support and Approvals Agentforce features, including some…",
